@startuml Screenshot_to_GUI_Flow
!theme aws-orange
title Сопоставление скриншота с BPG данными до выполнения GUI действий

skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam defaultFontColor black
top to bottom direction

' === Input Processing ===
package "🖼️ Screenshot Input Processing" #LightBlue {
  rectangle Input
  note right of Input
    📱 Current Screenshot
    • user_screen_capture.png (1920x1080, timestamp)

    🔍 YOLO Object Detection
    • Обнаружение UI элементов

    📝 OCR Text Recognition
    • Извлечение текста

    📐 Layout Analysis
    • Структура интерфейса

    **Технический стек:**
    • YOLOv8
    • PaddleOCR
    • OpenCV
    • Custom layout parser
  end note
}

' === Entity Matching ===
package "🎯 Entity Layer Matching" #LightGreen {
  rectangle Entity
  note right of Entity
    🔗 Cross-view Matching → EntityNode

    🛍️ Product: "Хлеб Бородинский" ($0.85)
    🛒 Cart: пустая
    🔍 Search: активное поле

    💡 Confidence:
    • Product 0.92
    • Cart 0.88
    • Search 0.95
    • Scene 0.91

    **Process:**
    • CLIP similarity
    • OCR fuzzy match
    • Historical patterns
    • Schema consistency
  end note
}

' === Pattern Recognition ===
package "⚙️ Pattern Layer Recognition" #LightYellow {
  rectangle Pattern
  note right of Pattern
    📋 Context Analysis
    🎯 Active Pattern Detection

    IF search_field active → product_search
    ELSE IF product visible → product_browse
    ELSE → unknown

    📊 Confidence: 0.87
  end note
}

' === Workflow Preparation ===
package "🔧 Workflow Layer Preparation" #LightCoral {
  rectangle Workflow
  note right of Workflow
    📝 Load Workflow Template
    🎯 Map UI Elements → WorkflowNode

    🔧 Selector Generation:
    • search_field → input[data-testid='search']
    • filter_price → button[aria-label='price filter']
    • add_to_cart → button.add-cart-btn
    • cart_icon → div.cart-indicator

    📊 Selector Confidence:
    • search_field 0.93
    • filter_price 0.78
    • add_to_cart 0.85
    • cart_icon 0.91

    **Strategy:**
    • CSS selectors
    • XPath
    • Visual coords
    • OCR fallback
  end note
}

' === User Intent Integration ===
package "👤 User Intent Integration" #Lavender {
  rectangle Intent
  note right of Intent
    💬 User Prompt:
    "Найди хлеб до $1 и закажи"

    🤖 Intent Parsed:
    • action=search_and_order
    • product="хлеб"
    • max_price="$1"

    🎯 Alignment:
    IF UI matches intent → Score 0.89
    ELSE → Navigation Required
  end note
}

' === Action Sequence Planning ===
package "📋 Action Sequence Planning" #Moccasin {
  rectangle Plan
  note right of Plan
    🎯 Generate Action Sequence

    📝 Planned Actions:
    1. type(search_field, "хлеб") [0.93]
    2. click(filter_price_button) [0.78]
    3. set_price_filter("$1") [0.82]
    4. scan_results() [0.70]
    5. click(add_to_cart, first_item) [0.85]
  end note
}

' === Execution with Feedback ===
package "🚀 RPA Execution with Feedback" #PaleGreen {
  rectangle Execution
  note right of Execution
    🤖 Execute Next Action
    📸 Capture Screenshot
    🔍 Verify Outcome

    IF success → Confidence +0.05
    ELSE → try alternative selector
    IF none → Escalate to HITL
  end note
}

' === Post-execution Learning ===
package "🎓 Post-execution Learning" #LightGreen {
  rectangle Learning
  note right of Learning
    📊 Collect Metrics:
    • Success rate
    • Time
    • Fallbacks
    • User confirmations

    🔄 Update BPG:
    • EntityNode
    • PatternNode
    • WorkflowNode
    • UIElementNode

    💾 Store Provenance Chain

    **Feedback:**
    • Successful selectors ↑
    • Failed selectors ↓
    • New UI → EntityNode
    • Pattern variations → templates
    • User corrections → ground truth
  end note
}

' === Connections ===
Input -down-> Entity
Entity -down-> Pattern
Pattern -down-> Workflow
Workflow -down-> Intent
Intent -down-> Plan
Plan -down-> Execution
Execution -down-> Learning

' === Legend (вместо отдельного note) ===
skinparam legendBackgroundColor white
skinparam legendBorderColor black
skinparam legendFontColor black

legend bottom
  == 🔑 Ключевые особенности ==
  1. Multi-modal Perception
     • YOLO, OCR, CLIP, Cross-view matching
  2. Real-time BPG Querying
     • Neo4j Cypher, Vector search, GNN predictions
  3. Adaptive Selector Strategy
     • CSS, XPath, Visual fallback, OCR
  4. Continuous Learning Loop
     • Feedback, templates, corrections, retraining
  5. Explainable Decision Trail
     • Evidence linking, Confidence, Human validation
end legend

@enduml